  (10, 'NO PLANS | DUPATTA (ZRW-21975)', 'stardust-bloom-zrw-21975', 'Soft ivory florals, playful pink borders and a floaty chiffon dupatta with just a hint of yellow. Pretty, breezy and made for wherever the day decides to take you. Component: Du...', 'Silk Chiffon', 3950, 4937, 'women', 6, 4, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0081/0283/8329/files/0K0A4420-1.jpg?v=1787292750', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0081/0283/8329/files/0K0A4446.jpg?v=1787292750', 'Multicolor, Pastel', 'S,M,L,XL', 4.9, 98, 0, 1, 20),
